# ── Windows "mark of the web" alternate-data-stream files ────────────────────
# WSL exposes NTFS ADS as literal files named "foo.txt:Zone.Identifier".
# The ':' is an illegal filename character on Windows, so if these are ever
# committed, every Windows clone fails with:
#   error: invalid path 'CMakeLists.txt:Zone.Identifier'
*:Zone.Identifier
*Zone.Identifier

